# Upload exclusions for `vercel deploy`.
#
# The Vercel CLI builds its file list from this file, not from .gitignore — measured on the six
# existing deployments of this project, whose archives all contain .local-auth/store.json, dist/
# and .netlify/functions/*.zip even though .gitignore has named those paths since 2026-10-25.
# Anything secret or build-generated that must stay on this machine is therefore named here too.
#
# Kept out deliberately: files the build needs stay in. `tsc --noEmit` reads tsconfig.json's
# include list (src, shared, tests, netlify, vercel), and `npm run build` regenerates dist/ and
# api/index.js, so nothing below is an input to either step.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.env.local
.local-auth
.netlify
.vercel
.secrets
dist
dist-ssr
out
coverage
node_modules
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
